{
  "function": "launchUri",
  "source": "src/main/launchers/epic/manifests.ts",
  "note": "decode: none\narg0 is the manifest fields the function reads ({ appName, catalogNamespace, catalogItemId }, or the whole parsed fixture manifest), arg1 the form: catalog or appname (any other string takes the appname branch).\nThe app name goes through encodeURIComponent: every byte of its UTF-8 encoding is %XX-escaped (upper-case hex) except A-Z a-z 0-9 - _ . ! ~ * ' ( ); a lone surrogate throws URIError \"URI malformed\". The catalog ids are put in raw, never escaped; an empty catalog id falls back to the appname form.",
